## Product Overview

NOMO is a hyperlocal quick-commerce platform designed specifically for Tier-2 and Tier-3 cities. Instead of relying on dark stores, 
NOMO partners with existing local retailers to deliver everyday essentials within minutes while helping neighborhood businesses grow digitally.
This not only assist the customers but aids the local stores which hit their sales due to evolution of quick deliveries in India.


## Problem Statement

Customers in Tier-2-3 cities often experience:
- Limited access to quick-commerce services
- Long delivery times
- Fragmented local retail ecosystem
- Lack of Local Product availability Online


Local stores struggle with:

- Loss of Business due to quick commerce Giants
- Digital presence
- Online order management (POS) and Delivery system 
- Customer acquisition
- Last-mile logistics


## Vision Statement

To become the preferred hyperlocal commerce platform that empowers Standardized local businesses and provides customers in Tier-2 and Tier-3 cities with fast,
reliable, and affordable deliveries.


## Mission

Bridge the gap between local retailers and modern consumers by enabling technology-driven,
rapid commerce without requiring expensive dark-store infrastructure.


