## Assumptions

- Customers value delivery speed over brand loyalty.
- Local retailers can fulfill orders within 10 minutes.
- Delivery radius remains below 5 km.
- Merchants maintain accurate inventory.
- Unsaturated and old loacal stored need to be standardized.

---

## Business Goals


- Increase digital adoption among local retailers
- Deliver orders within 15–30 minutes
